      "content": "idk, it feels like you're being a bit vague. like, if we look at the specific policies that have been passed recently, is there any actual consensus that the trade-off is worth it? or is the \"economic stability\" thing just used to justify programs that are clearly making it harder for people to actually get back into the workforce?",
